Self-evolving coding agent: self-built loop, OpenAI-compatible dialects, read-only coding tools (phase 0)

Usage: cadmus <COMMAND>

Commands:
  chat  Chat with the agent (one shot: prompt in, final answer out), with read-only coding tools confined to the current directory
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
